      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like youre just reading from a script. \"reach out to a professional\" is what everyone says but it's not helpful. it's just another thing to do. i'm not even asking for a hotline, i'm asking if there is any philosophical sense to it. like, if someone's life is just pure suffering, is it wrong to want it to stop?",
